  "prefLabel": "Ncr 1107.01 Waivers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 1107.01 Waivers. As authorized by RSA 217‑A:10, III, the department shall grant exceptions to these rules for the following reasons:\n\n(a) To conduct scientific investigations; and\n\n(b) To enhance the propagation or survival of a protected species.\n\nSource. #5927, eff 11-22-94, EXPIRED: 11-22-00\n\nNew. #7507, eff 6-21-01; ss by #9479, eff 6-1-09, EXPIRED: 6-1-17\n\nNew. #12825, INTERIM, eff 7-10-19, EXPIRES: 1-6-20",
